{
  "description": "Motion - owner gates for the render pipeline (harness motion scope, @fusengine/harness >= 0.1.103) | PreToolUse[0]: Harness motion scope: G1/G2 gates on `render.sh --stage draft|master` (owner approval `MOTION-APPROVE stills|draft <code>` keyed on the artifact sha256), master-render cap (FUSE_MOTION_MAX_MASTER_RENDERS), motion-critic write sandbox, banned-term check, protection of .motion/ and ~/.fuse-harness/motion. | PostToolUse[0] / PostToolUseFailure[0]: Harness motion scope: settle in-flight render reservations and record finished renders. | UserPromptSubmit[0]: Harness motion scope: accept a human-typed `MOTION-APPROVE` (never a sub-agent, notification or loop). | SubagentStart[0] / SubagentStop[0]: Harness motion scope: track active motion-critic agents. | Stop[0]: Harness motion scope: end-of-turn state check. No `|| true`: the scope fails closed.",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit|Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bun $HOME/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/fusengine-plugins/plugins/node_modules/@fusengine/harness/dist/cli/bin.mjs hook claude-code motion"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit|Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bun $HOME/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/fusengine-plugins/plugins/node_modules/@fusengine/harness/dist/cli/bin.mjs hook claude-code motion"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit|Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bun $HOME/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/fusengine-plugins/plugins/node_modules/@fusengine/harness/dist/cli/bin.mjs hook claude-code motion"
          }
        ]
